Phrazie Project Plan (MVP)
1. Overview

Project Name: Phrazie
Category: DJ performance tool / Visual timing assistant

One-line definition:
Phrazie enables DJs to pre-schedule and trigger visuals in sync with musical structure (phrases, breaks, drops) with minimal live interaction.

2. Target Users
DJs without a dedicated VJ
DJs with basic visual assets but no VJ workflow expertise
Performers who want tighter sync between music and visuals
Small to mid-size venue performers
3. Problem Statement

Current challenges:

Hard to find a visual engineer who understands music structure
DJs cannot reliably control visuals while mixing
Existing tools (e.g. Resolume Arena) are too complex for solo DJs
Visuals often miss key musical moments (drops, breaks, transitions)
4. Product Goal (MVP)

Enable a DJ to:

Prepare a visual set in under 10 minutes and trigger visuals precisely at the right musical moments during a live performance with minimal effort.

