14. MVP Success Criteria
User can prepare a set within 10 minutes
Trigger can be set within 3 seconds during performance
Visual transitions occur on correct timing
No VJ experience required
15. Risks & Priorities
Key Risks
Timing inaccuracy
Playback lag or instability
Overly complex UI
Priority Order
Stability
Simplicity
Timing accuracy
Final Execution Principle

Do NOT try to build a full visual platform.

Instead:

Build the smallest system that reliably lets a DJ control visuals through musical timing.
